    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Ultranatural</strong>, a no-frills PvP arena shooter built for quick, competitive fun. This is a student project from S4G Berlin, designed with simplicity in mind to modernize the classic arena shooter experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ultranatural, you\u2019ll face off against friends on a single, carefully designed map, using one traditional weapon to prove your skills. The focus is on skill-based combat, fast movement, and intense one-on-one or small team matches. With easy-to-host servers, it\u2019s a perfect way to settle who\u2019s the better shot among your group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a fan of old-school shooters or just looking for a quick, straightforward game to play with friends, Ultranatural keeps the action sharp, simple, and fun.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Ultranatural</strong>, a no-frills PvP arena shooter built for quick, competitive fun. This is a student project from S4G Berlin, designed with simplicity in mind to modernize the classic arena shooter experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ultranatural, you\u2019ll face off against friends on a single, carefully designed map, using one traditional weapon to prove your skills. The focus is on skill-based combat, fast movement, and intense one-on-one or small team matches. With easy-to-host servers, it\u2019s a perfect way to settle who\u2019s the better shot among your group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a fan of old-school shooters or just looking for a quick, straightforward game to play with friends, Ultranatural keeps the action sharp, simple, and fun.</p>",
    "short_description": "Ultranatural is a fast-paced PvP arena shooter where skill and speed rule. Battle friends on one hand-crafted map with a single essential weapon. Easy server hosting makes it simple to jump into intense duels or team skirmishes. Pure, straightforward competition awaits!",
